{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the story of a sophomore at Ocean City University with a tragic past. Three years after a close friend's unfortunate accident, followed shortly by the death of your parents, two new young women come into your life, triggering a chain of events that lead to you reconnecting with your first love and learning the truth about the events of three years ago. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552130/extras/descrip_1.jpg?t=1734184393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the help of some of your parents' former FBI colleagues and an international task force, you'll dive head first into an investigation that will expose a ruthless syndicate who's reach extends far beyond Ocean City, making new friends along the way and choosing which relationships to nurture into something more. Be careful though, as some choices will make you the arbiter of life and death and some consequences may just be unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552130/extras/descrip_2.jpg?t=1734184393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a stirring story and enjoy the companionship of the lovely ladies in your life as you navigate a path towards extricating the Syndicate from your life and the lives of those close to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552130/extras/descrip_3.jpg?t=1734184393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this choice-based adult visual novel, you will make decisions that will alter your relationships with those around you and guide the story down divergent paths. Along the way, you will unlock bonus images in the image gallery, earn achievements, and encounter animated lewd scenes, unlocking them in the replay gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552130/extras/descrip_4.jpg?t=1734184393\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/4ef22afc9251699f8a11bc5fc14788bad6b90de9.jpg"},{"name":"Enjoy the View","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/57dfc280c29e3575525e559dc29bfd1f3f77d352.jpg"},{"name":"Friendly Meal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/388c55fc76e28a69c1a1220974856d271694c595.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019m in a Band","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/1162ddb5d76f0a03d0cd749c875826644deecfba.jpg"},{"name":"That Just Happened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/187658b4775cd52a1cdf1b1ea26f0de70eaf3c99.jpg"},{"name":"Keeping it Clean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/a6d9b70b4c14cd4aed164d9fef9658b87217a243.jpg"},{"name":"Trap Avoided","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/ab8fa498fe027b4bd44a91045ea99ddb3c99eefd.jpg"},{"name":"My Treat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/bf0e5811539ada4f1a923f9ee32c3ec6f9cadca6.jpg"},{"name":"Protector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/df186db8d1b0e37a7840e4d3837cbbb7571b04b7.jpg"},{"name":"I Remember Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2552130/c18dcfcd23f8718683574eace1e12a874cc09036.jpg"}],"total":59},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2552130?t=1734184393","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstati